      {
        "id": "act_regeneration_yieq",
        "name": "Regeneration",
        "actionType": "trait",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>Dirt-Under-Nails regains 10 hit points at the start of his turn if he is in contact with the ground. If Dirt-Under-Nails takes fire damage, this trait doesn't function at the start of his next turn. Dirt-Under-Nails dies only if he starts his turn with 0 hit points and doesn't regenerate.</p>",
